{% comment %}
  Inlines the Only Coffee Project arrow mark (the "Y" of the wordmark, used
  standalone). Inlined rather than an <img> so it inherits `currentColor` —
  the source SVG's fill is set to currentColor, so it picks up whatever text
  color its container has (e.g. the menu drawer's theme-editor text color)
  instead of being locked to the brand blue.

  Size it from the caller via CSS on a wrapping element; `width/height: 100%`
  on the svg overrides its own width/height attributes.
{% endcomment %}
